### 4.5 Net Amount Payable and Payment Details


4.5.1 This section shall include, but not limited to, the following:

- a) Total amount (sum of all summary charges);
- b) Deposit/advance amount paid (if any);
- c) Details of any discount/concession;
- d) Net bill amount;
- e) Tax applicable;
- f) Final amount payable (inclusive of taxes);
- g) Amount paid and corresponding payment receipt number (mode of payment such as online/cash payment, credit note, TPA or corporate); and
- h) Details of authorized signatory.

#### 4.5.2 Insurance Coverage Details (if applicable)

- a) Name of the insurance provider;
- b) Policy number;
- c) Claim ID (if made available);
- d) Client Name (where applicable);
- e) Amount approved by the insurance company; and
- f) Amount paid by the patient.

#### 4.5.3 Issuance of Final Bill

The bill issued by the healthcare facility to the patient shall be signed and stamped by the authorized signatory. The bill shall also include a provision for recording the signature of the patient or, where applicable, the next of kin. In case the next of kin is signing, their name and relationship to the patient shall be clearly mentioned.

